# TopoGPT. The distribution is named MapPrior. The fork declares its dependencies by name only,
# without versions, so the pins above stay authoritative. Its dataset-generation devkits are
# extras and are left uninstalled -- waymo-open-dataset pins tensorflow and nuplan-devkit pins
# its own torch, so neither co-resolves with this lock.
MapPrior @ git+https://github.com/ewfuentes/TopoGPT.git@1a60753cc43652efe295ab0f7bb06b74d7916a9a
# MapPrior's `flow` extra, needed by modules/flow -- configs/model/finetune.yaml resolves it as a
# hydra _target_ at instantiation time, so no import analysis finds it. Named here rather than
# taken as an extra because the extra is unversioned; this pins the one package and lets uv pull
# the rest behind it. Costs nine lock entries -- torchcfm, torchdyn, torchsde, torchcde,
# torchdiffeq, pot, poethepoet, pastel, trampoline -- and no version change to anything already
# pinned.
torchcfm==1.0.7
